+    * the mode itself.** `ir3.c:305` caps occupancy at 8 waves and kills the
+    * process for a barrier shader that needs more; `ir3_get_min_reg_count`
+    * inflates the minimum register count to enforce that cap. Both return
+    * immediately when the errata bit is clear. On a chip without it the mode
