+    *
+    * That gating is why upstream leaves this to TU_DEBUG globally: on a6xx and
+    * a7xx, where the errata is set, a global default really would be costly.
+    * Keyed on the errata instead of on the debug flag, it turns on exactly
+    * where it is free.
+    *
+    * What is not established is the hardware-side cost. Interleaving waves
